Assets/ThirdParty/RPG_FPS_game_assets_industrial/Map_v2Settings.lighting
Assets/ThirdParty/RPG_FPS_game_assets_industrial/Assets_showcase_scene.unity
Assets/ThirdParty/RPG_FPS_game_assets_industrial/Assets_showcase_sceneSettings.lighting
Assets/ThirdParty/Mirror/Examples/
Assets/ThirdParty/Mirror/Examples.meta
Assets/ThirdParty/TextMesh Pro/Examples & Extras/
Assets/ThirdParty/TextMesh Pro/Examples & Extras.meta
